<title>USA: American Consolidated says buys NovaVision.</title>
<headline>American Consolidated says buys NovaVision.</headline>
<dateline>RALEIGH, N.C. 1997-05-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Consolidated Laboratories Inc said Friday it purchased privately held NovaVision Inc through a merger with a subsidiary.</p>
<p>The company did not disclose a purchase price. American Consolidated said that in conjunction with the transaction it has received $1.6 million term loan financing from Sirrom Investments Inc.</p>
<p>No further information was immediately available.</p>
</text>
